<section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">How to Use</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-12">
      Follow the simple steps below to download videos from your favorite sites.
    </p>

    <%- include('partials/ad-unit', { adSlot: 'howto-top' }) %>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Copy the Video URL</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Open the video on your browser or app and copy the link from the address bar or share menu.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Paste It on the Home Page</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Go to the <a href="/" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">home page</a>, paste the URL into the input box, and click “Get Video.”</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Choose a Format</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Once we fetch the video info, select the quality and file format from the dropdown. “Best available” is usually the safest choice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Download</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Click “Download Now.” When the server finishes processing, an “Open File” button will appear so you can save the video.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/ad-unit', { adSlot: 'howto-bottom' }) %>

    <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 border-l-4 border-amber-500 rounded-xl">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 mb-2">Important Reminder</h3>
      <p class="text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-200 text-sm">
        Only download videos you own or have permission to use. Respect copyright laws and each platform’s Terms of Service.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
